1799:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****   *            @arg TIM_TS_NONE: No trigger is needed
1800:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****   * @param  CommutationSource the Commutation Event source
